y to grow louder. Readers should therefore watch whether government discussions produce concrete measures. The carbon-tax divide that Tata Steel describes between India and the EU suggests that trade friction may extend beyond anti-dumping duties. At the same time, Tata Steel's delayed 40 mtpa target alongside its larger 50 mt ambition suggests that execution, not intent, may be the main constraint. Raw-material security remains a structural weak point, since coking coal dependence on imports was noted by several sources. Investment in automotive grades by AM/NS India and the JSW JFE venture could reduce reliance on imports of specialised steel. The material does not quantify any of these effects.","watchNext":["Details of the EU duty's scope, duration and company-specific rates, which are not given in the material","Any government measures arising from the industry's discussions on cheap imports","Targets and timeline of the draft National Steel Policy 2047","Capacity, ownership and product focus of the JSW JFE Steel Limited joint venture","Further NMDC pig iron auctions and the price levels achieved"],"ai":{"provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-5-5","generatedAt":"2026-11-19T04:19:34.001Z"},"articleCount":36,"sources":[{"name":"Shanghai Metals Market","count":3},{"name":"scanx.trade","count":3},{"name":"The Hindu BusinessLine","count":3},{"name":"Business Today","count":3},{"name":"Mint","count":2},{"name":"Indian Masterminds","count":2},{"name":"TradingView","count":2},{"name":"Urban Acres","count":2},{"name":"EU Law Live","count":1},{"name":"KNN India","count":1},{"name":"Deccan Herald","count":1},{"name":"Moneycontrol.com","count":1},{"name":"News On AIR","count":1},{"name":"Asianet Newsable","count":1},{"name":"PR Newswire","count":1},{"name":"ETV Bharat","count":1},{"name":"Business Standard","count":1},{"name":"The Economic Times","count":1},{"name":"PSU Watch","count":1},{"name":"The Tribune","count":1},{"name":"Indian Chemical News","count":1},{"name